"""Small published-price reference; no inferred sizing or final quote."""
import json,html
OPTIONS=[('AC + indoor coil','3-ton Essential configuration',7225),('Heat pump + air handler','3-ton Essential configuration; no supplemental heat package',11600),('Gas furnace only','60,000-BTU, 90%+ Essential configuration',5500)]
def add(out):
    rows=''.join('<tr><th scope="row">'+html.escape(n)+'</th><td>'+html.escape(a)+'</td><td>$'+format(p,',')+'</td></tr>' for n,a,p in OPTIONS)
    choices=''.join('<option value="'+str(i)+'">'+html.escape(n)+'</option>' for i,(n,a,p) in enumerate(OPTIONS))
    section='<section class="price-reference" id="installation-ballpark" aria-labelledby="ballpark-title"><div class="eyebrow">A SIMPLE STARTING POINT</div><h2 id="ballpark-title">What would it cost?</h2><p>These are example installed starting prices from Middletown HVAC’s published estimator, checked November 4, 2026. Choose an example setup—not a system size for your house.</p><label for="ballpark-system">Example installation</label><select id="ballpark-system">'+choices+'</select><p id="ballpark-result" role="status" aria-live="polite"><strong>$7,225 starting price</strong> · 3-ton Essential configuration</p><details><summary>See all three example prices</summary><table><caption>Published Essential installation examples</caption><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Example scope</th><th>Starting price</th></tr></thead><tbody>'+rows+'</tbody></table></details><p>Examples use the base configuration without optional add-ons. The heat-pump example excludes supplemental heat. These are not oil-to-gas conversion or ductless project quotes. Sizing, compatibility, fuel or utility changes, electrical work, ductwork and site conditions can change the scope and price. Middletown confirms the complete proposal after assessing your home.</p><p><a class="btn primary" href="https://www.mtownhvac.com/install-estimate/">Use Middletown’s full installation estimator ↗</a></p><p><a href="/services/oil-to-gas-conversion/">Planning an oil conversion?</a> · <a href="/services/ductless-mini-splits/">Looking at ductless?</a> Discuss those project-specific options with the team.</p></section>'
    f=out/'services/replacement-estimates/index.html';s=f.read_text().replace('</article>',section+'</article>',1);s=s.replace('</body>','<script src="/assets/ballpark.js" defer></script></body>');f.write_text(s)
    (out/'assets/ballpark.js').write_text('const examples='+json.dumps(OPTIONS)+';\nconst choice=document.getElementById("ballpark-system");choice.addEventListener("change",()=>{const row=examples[Number(choice.value)];document.getElementById("ballpark-result").textContent="$"+row[2].toLocaleString("en-US")+" starting price · "+row[1];});')
